    {
      "page_title": "Constraints with extends",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What is a constraint?",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`T extends X` means T must be ==assignable== to X",
            "It is an __upper bound__, not class inheritance",
            "Any subtype of X passes; the caller's exact type is kept",
            "`T extends unknown` is a no-op bound; `{}` or `NonNullable` drops null/undefined"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Why we need it",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "function len<T extends",
            "  { length: number }>(x: T): T {",
            "  console.log(x.length); // ok",
            "  return x; // still T",
            "}"
          ],
          "note": "Returns T, not { length: number }"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Without the bound, `x.length` is an **error**: T could be anything",
            "Accepts strings, arrays and `{ length: 3 }`",
            "`len(\"hi\")` returns the literal `\"hi\"`, not the bound"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Constraint shapes",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Shape",
            "Written as",
            "Use"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Union",
              "`T extends string | number`",
              "limit to a few types"
            ],
            [
              "Other param",
              "`<T, K extends keyof T>`",
              "safe key lookup"
            ],
            [
              "Constructor",
              "`T extends new (...args: any[]) => object`",
              "mixins"
            ],
            [
              "Generic interface",
              "`interface Repo<T extends { id: string }>`",
              "typed repository"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "text": "caller type",
                "sub": "e.g. string[]",
                "ink": "blue"
              },
              {
                "text": "check: assignable to bound?",
                "sub": "{ length: number }",
                "ink": "purple"
              },
              {
                "text": "T kept as string[]",
                "sub": "not widened",
                "ink": "green"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "interface Repo<T extends",
            "  { id: string }> {",
            "  get(id: string): T;",
            "}",
            "Repo<{ id: string; n: 1 }>; // ok",
            "Repo<{ n: 1 }>; // error"
          ],
          "note": "Bound is checked at use site"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "Remember",
          "text": "A bound lets you READ members of X, but T stays the caller's exact type."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Common mistakes",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`T extends object` also accepts arrays and functions",
            "Returning `{}` where T is expected fails: T may be a narrower subtype",
            "`T extends U` (constraint) is not `T extends U ? A : B` (conditional type)"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "function make<T extends {a:1}>(): T {",
            "  return { a: 1 }; // error",
            "}",
            "// T could be { a: 1; b: 2 }"
          ],
          "note": "Plain value is not assignable to T"
        }
